sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Coder<br/>AgentLoop
    participant H as Context<br/>Engine
    participant R as Rails
    participant M as LLM
    participant T as ToolRegistry<br/>+ tools
    participant S as Guard<br/>Blender sandbox
    participant D as Skill<br/>library

    Note over C: messages = [system, user]
    loop every step (≤ max_steps)
        C->>H: messages (full history)
        H-->>C: view: omit stale scripts, pin current one
        C->>M: chat(view, tool schemas)
        M-->>C: text or tool_calls
        C->>R: after_llm: truncated?
        alt "I'm done"
            C->>R: on_final_answer
            R-->>C: done · nudge · stop
        else tool calls
            C->>T: execute(ToolCall)
            opt load_skill
                T->>D: read skill code → preamble
            end
            T->>S: guard → prepend skills → run in empty scene
            S-->>T: result (watchdog on hangs)
            T-->>C: tool message (error as observation)
            C->>R: stuck? over budget?
        end
    end
